ISLANDGAME_AETHERIA_POLICE_HQ_1F_Wanderer_Text_0:
# 34 "data/maps/ISLANDGAME_AETHERIA_POLICE_HQ_1F/scripts.pory"
	.string "In our most recent raid, we seized\n"
	.string "hundreds of illegally modified copies of\l"
	.string "Pokémon Fire Red.\p"
	.string "A soundtrack in the game was altered to\n"
	.string "contain high-pitched tones that only\l"
	.string "children could hear, causing erratic\l"
	.string "behavior.\p"
	.string "Many of these cartridges were already\n"
	.string "distributed across Marya, and have\l"
	.string "resulted in the hospitalization and\l"
	.string "even deaths of children.\p"
	.string "We believe that the programmer behind\n"
	.string "this intended to use these game\l"
	.string "cartridges as a means of brainwashing\l"
	.string "children for nefarious purposes.$"
